      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "……そうだね。\r\n焦らずに、何があったのか事情を知らないとだね……。",
        "official_en": "You’re right...I shouldn’t jump to conclusions yet. Not until I have the bigger picture at least.",
        "real_en": null
