        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C02_228_01:228_01_018:9052158e",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C02_228_01:228_01_018:9052158e",
        "jp_sha256": "93613a6f8cb8493d3a7f0e2c6371ec3d6c851432db4a2471f6b9848bef5e5758",
        "official_en_sha256": "6c118fb7ebf8dadcbba944083ab2e854caa16ec14dea28f0536aa3ba5f5369f6"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "……違いがいつの間にか大きくって話なら、\r\n俺にもわかるんだ。",
        "official_en": "I can actually relate to what you said about differences between one another getting bigger.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "KEEP"
      },
