        "official_en_sha256": "4e9cd78f4738560782f9c1495cc94c490a8fd8a7e2bbd3f0dbe778899751d584"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ああ、確かにあなたたち\r\n兄弟っぽいところもあるもんね。\r\nラスウェルが世話好きの兄貴っていうか。",
        "official_en": "Yeah, you guys seem more like brothers than friends. Lasswell is definitely the older-brother type, huh?",
        "real_en": "Yeah, there's something brotherly about you two. Lasswell's like a caring older brother."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
