      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "うん……アタシはくじけない。\r\nアタシが兄さんの目を覚まさないとだから。",
        "official_en": "Yeah...I’m not giving up on him just yet. I’ve got to be the one to smack some sense into him.",
        "real_en": "Yeah... I won’t let this break me. I have to bring my older brother to his senses."
      },
