        "official_en_sha256": "546e49e3237d09eb573a2e81ba37548417633c88669b2ab2e4e3912087fb0364"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "その違いがいつの間にか\r\nこんなにも大きくなっちゃうなんて……。",
        "official_en": "But even so, I never expected those differences would end up this big.",
        "real_en": "I never thought the differences between us could grow so big before I even noticed..."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
