        "official_en_sha256": "80eeaa38b9a253a7100d64c1d0b1192cac8c74f90112e7937a984c46e3542130"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "たしかに……。\r\nどんなに変わってしまっても、どこかで繋がってる……か。\r\nくよくよしすぎるなってことなのかもね。",
        "official_en": "Yeah...I guess we’re connected somewhere somehow, no matter how changed he is. It can’t keep me down forever.",
        "real_en": "Yeah... No matter how much he’s changed, we’re still connected somehow... Maybe I shouldn’t worry so much."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
