        "official_en_sha256": "7a17e0d0bbba393274e99a0c60844d90014a2e11e3453a02350d51a6934c7816"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "でもさ、そんなことを言われて\r\n俺が嬉しいと本当に思っているのかな。\r\nあいつは。",
        "official_en": "But I wonder... Does he really think hearing that would make me happy?",
        "real_en": null
